Fictional EP Tracklist

Track 1: The Meridian Erases Itself
- Story & Context: Recorded in an unheated attic overlooking the rail tracks of Station Łódź-Kaliska, this track captures the exact night producer Maja found a discarded diagnostic drive hidden in a textile loom. The song begins with the faint hum of a cooling fan that accidentally matched the key of E-flat major, leading into a blooming saxophone line that feels like a machine learning to breathe. Mid-way through recording, the power surged, leaving a distinctive crackle in the master tape that the band refused to edit out. Maja sings "Hold your copper breath until the border melts away" as the track swells into a sweeping, tape-warped pop climax.
